<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#1c1a17;
    --paper:#f6f1e7;
    --card:#fffdf8;
    --gold:#b8862d;
    --gold-deep:#8a5f16;
    --line:#e3d8c2;
    --shadow:rgba(60,44,18,.12);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  body{
    font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    line-height:1.5;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  header{
    text-align:center;
    padding:48px 20px 28px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 80% at 50% -20%, #fbf6ec 0%, var(--paper) 70%);
  }
  header .cross{
    font-size:26px;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:.4em;margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  header h1{
    font-size:clamp(30px,7vw,52px);
    font-weight:400;
    letter-spacing:.02em;
  }
  header h1 span{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-deep)}
  header p{
    margin-top:12px;
    font-size:15px;
    letter-spacing:.18em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:#7a6a4d;
    font-family:system-ui,Arial,sans-serif;
  }

  .grid{
    max-width:1120px;
    margin:34px auto;
    padding:0 16px 60px;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    gap:16px;
  }
  @media(min-width:820px){
    .grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px}
  }

  .card{
    background:var(--card);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:10px;
    overflow:hidden;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    box-shadow:0 2px 10px var(--shadow);
    transition:transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease;
  }
  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 10px 22px var(--shadow)}

  .card .thumb{
    aspect-ratio:1/1;
    width:100%;
    object-fit:cover;
    display:block;
    background:#efe7d6;
  }
  .card .body{
    padding:14px 14px 16px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:12px;
    flex:1;
  }
  .card h2{
    font-size:15px;
    font-weight:400;
    line-height:1.35;
    flex:1;
  }
  .buy{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:8px;
    text-decoration:none;
    background:var(--gold);
    color:#fff;
    font-family:system-ui,Arial,sans-serif;
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:.08em;
    padding:10px 12px;
    border-radius:6px;
    transition:background .15s ease;
  }
  .buy:hover{background:var(--gold-deep)}
  .buy svg{width:16px;height:16px;fill:currentColor}
  .intro{
    max-width:720px;
    margin:34px auto 0;
    padding:0 22px;
    text-align:center;
    font-size:clamp(16px,3.6vw,19px);
    font-style:italic;
    color:#5f513a;
    line-height:1.55;
  }
  footer{
    text-align:center;
    padding:26px 20px 40px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    font-family:system-ui,Arial,sans-serif;
    font-size:12px;
    color:#8a7a5d;
	
  }
  .mission{
    max-width:760px;
    margin:10px auto 0;
    padding:48px 24px 8px;
    text-align:center;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .mission .cross-sm{
    font-size:20px;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:.4em;margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .mission h2{
    font-size:clamp(24px,5vw,34px);
    font-weight:400;
    margin-bottom:22px;
    color:var(--gold-deep);
  }
  .mission p{
    font-size:clamp(15px,3.4vw,17px);
    line-height:1.75;
    margin-bottom:18px;
    color:#4a4032;
  }
  .mission .cta{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:14px;
    background:var(--gold);
    color:#fff;
    font-family:system-ui,Arial,sans-serif;
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:.08em;
    text-decoration:none;
    padding:12px 30px;
    border-radius:6px;
    transition:background .15s ease;
  }
  .mission .cta:hover{background:var(--gold-deep)}
  .social{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:18px;
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .social a{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    width:40px;
    height:40px;
    border-radius:50%;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    color:#7a6a4d;
    background:var(--card);
    transition:color .15s ease, border-color .15s ease, transform .15s ease;
  }
  .social a:hover{
    color:var(--gold-deep);
    border-color:var(--gold);
    transform:translateY(-2px);
  }
  .social svg{width:19px;height:19px;fill:currentColor}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="cross">&#10013;</div>
  <h1>Still <span>With</span> Jesus</h1>
  <p>Faith &middot; Grace &middot; Everyday Blessings</p>
</header>
<section class="mission">
  <div class="cross-sm">&#10013;</div>
  <h2>Walking Every Day, Still With Jesus</h2>
  <p>Faith isn't only for Sunday mornings. It lives in the small corners of an ordinary day &mdash; the mug you hold at dawn, the words on your wall, the necklace resting close to your heart. These quiet reminders have a way of pulling us back to what matters when the world grows loud.</p>
  <p>Still With Jesus began with one simple hope: to help believers carry their faith with them, everywhere they go. Every item here is chosen to comfort, to encourage, and to keep His presence near &mdash; a gentle whisper that you are never walking alone.</p>
  <p>When you find something that speaks to your heart, we invite you to bring it home. Each purchase you make through our links helps us keep this little corner of faith alive and growing, at no extra cost to you. It's a small way we grow together &mdash; you, us, and the message we love to share.</p>
  <a class="cta" href="#grid">Explore the Collection</a>
</section>
<p class="intro">Discover thousands of inspiring designs — tap View Deal to shop</p>
<main class="grid" id="grid"></main>

